FnTerminal changes the extracted Vue components to use a browser WebSocket
transport through the fnOS unified gateway instead of Wails desktop bindings.
Terminal-only controls replace unsupported desktop protocol, AI and system
window actions. Modified files contain notices; original sources and hashes
are preserved in third_party/uniterm. Uniterm's license and third-party notices
are included in the application. FnTerminal is an independent adaptation.

